{"chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2","number":1,"title":"Erweiterte Satzklammer","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Unser Unternehmen hat sich mittlerweile eine klare Position zur Chancengleichheit erarbeitet","speaker":"Franzi","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Das freut mich sehr Wird bei der Einstellung jedoch auch der Migrationshintergrund berücksichtigt","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Nein wir haben sämtliche Kriterien bewusst neutral gestaltet","speaker":"Franzi","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Das setzt aber viel Arbeit voraus","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ja aber es lohnt sich für die Chancengleichheit wirklich","speaker":"Franzi","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"die Chancengleichheit","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"die Chancengleichheit","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-01-erweiterte-satzklammer","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"führen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":